OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cooler start than of
OL,6,Flate, Friday will be a mostly dry day
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. An
OL,8,Fisolated shower possible in the north.
OL,9,FWinds will be generally light and it
OL,10,Fwill feel pleasantly warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry night will follow with
OL,14,Fclear spells and generally light
OL,15,Fwinds. Feeling rather cool and fresh
OL,16,Fonce again for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
