OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FWinds remaining generally
OL,6,Flight with plenty of sunny spells. An
OL,7,Fisolated light shower is possible, but
OL,8,Fmost staying dry. Feeling pleasant in
OL,9,Fthe sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,13,FBreezier with some rain likely on
OL,14,FMonday and Tuesday, turning a little
OL,15,Fwarmer too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
